msgctxt "model:ir.message,text:msg_guide_usage"
msgid ""
"RESTAURANT - USAGE GUIDE\n"
"\n"
"1. Setup (manager)\n"
" - Restaurant > Configuration > Restaurants: create the restaurant, rates (service, taxes, delivery) and a warehouse for stock.\n"
" - Create areas (room, terrace, bar) and tables with their seats.\n"
" - Mark products as menu items (Restaurant tab): course, preparation station (kitchen/bar), recipe.\n"
" - Menus: create menus with hours and optional prices (breakfast, lunch, happy hour).\n"
" - Cash: create the banknote and coin denominations of your currency.\n"
"\n"
"2. Cash session (cashier)\n"
" - Open your cash session and count the banknotes and coins of the drawer.\n"
" - Cash payments are only accepted while a session is open.\n"
" - At closing, count again: the difference and the suspect notes are shown to the manager.\n"
"\n"
"3. Service\n"
" - Restaurant > Service > Orders: new order, choose type (dine-in, bar tab, takeaway, delivery) and the table.\n"
" - Add items (give a guest number to split the bill), then click Send: items go to the kitchen or bar screen.\n"
" - Kitchen/Bar screens: Start, Ready, then waiters click Serve.\n"
"\n"
"4. Payment\n"
" - Add one or several payments (cash, card, mobile, voucher, account) then click Pay. Stock is consumed from recipes.\n"
" - Print the bill, the 80 mm ticket or the bill by guest from the Print action.\n"
"\n"
"5. Delivery\n"
" - Create a delivery order with address and phone, send it, assign a driver, Dispatch, then Delivered or Delivery Failed.\n"
"\n"
"6. Reservations\n"
" - Book a table with date, time and guests; click Seat on arrival to open the order automatically.\n"
"\n"
"7. Reports\n"
" - Dashboard shows live activity; Restaurant Sales gives daily sales by product."
msgstr ""
"RESTORAN - GID ITILIZASYON\n"
"\n"
"1. Konfigirasyon (responsab)\n"
" - Restoran > Konfigirasyon > Restoran : kreye restoran an, to li yo (sèvis, taks, livrezon) ak yon depo pou estòk la.\n"
" - Kreye zòn yo (sal manje, teras, ba) ak tab yo ak kantite plas yo.\n"
" - Make pwodui yo kòm atik meni (onglè Restoran) : kou, pòs preparasyon (kwizin/ba), resèt.\n"
" - Meni : kreye meni ak orè ak pri opsyonèl (manje maten, manje midi, happy hour).\n"
" - Kès : kreye biyè ak pyès lajan ou an.\n"
"\n"
"2. Sesyon kès (kesye)\n"
" - Louvri sesyon kès ou a epi konte biyè ak pyès ki nan tiwa a.\n"
" - Yo aksepte peman an lajan kach sèlman lè yon sesyon louvri.\n"
" - Lè w ap fèmen, konte ankò : diferans lan ak biyè sispèk yo montre responsab la.\n"
"\n"
"3. Sèvis\n"
" - Restoran > Sèvis > Kòmand : nouvo kòmand, chwazi tip la (sou plas, nòt ba, pou pote ale, livrezon) ak tab la.\n"
" - Ajoute atik yo (bay yon nimewo moun pou divize nòt la), epi klike sou Voye : atik yo ale sou ekran kwizin nan oswa ekran ba a.\n"
" - Ekran kwizin/ba : Kòmanse, Pare, apre sèvè yo klike sou Sèvi.\n"
"\n"
"4. Peman\n"
" - Ajoute youn oswa plizyè peman (lajan kach, kat, mobil, bon, kont) epi klike sou Peye. Estòk la diminye selon resèt yo.\n"
" - Enprime nòt la, tikè 80 mm lan oswa nòt pa moun nan ak aksyon Enprime.\n"
"\n"
"5. Livrezon\n"
" - Kreye yon kòmand livrezon ak adrès ak telefòn, voye l, bay yon livrè, Voye livre, apre Livre oswa Livrezon echwe.\n"
"\n"
"6. Rezèvasyon\n"
" - Rezève yon tab ak dat, lè ak kantite moun ; klike sou Enstale lè yo rive pou louvri kòmand lan otomatikman.\n"
"\n"
"7. Rapò\n"
" - Tablo de bò a montre aktivite an dirèk ; Vant restoran an bay vant chak jou pa pwodui."

